-name\">Checkout p95 > 2s</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</figure>\n","individual":true},{"label":"Fishbone, interactive","html":"<div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 mb-3\">\n  <button class=\"btn\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-size=\"sm\" data-diagram-for=\"dg-fish-live\" data-diagram-action=\"prev\"\n    >Previous</button\n  >\n  <button class=\"btn\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-size=\"sm\" data-diagram-for=\"dg-fish-live\" data-diagram-action=\"next\"\n    >Next</button\n  >\n  <button class=\"btn\" data-variant=\"ghost\" data-size=\"sm\" data-diagram-for=\"dg-fish-live\" data-diagram-action=\"clear\"\n    >Clear</button\n  >\n  <output class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\" data-diagram-for=\"dg-fish-live\"\n    >Click a box or an arrow - or press Next.</output\n  >\n</div>\n<figure\n  class=\"diagram\"\n  id=\"dg-fish-live\"\n  data-interactive\n  data-type=\"fishbone\"\n  aria-label=\"Root causes of checkout latency\"\n>\n  <figcaption class=\"diagram-caption\">\n    <span class=\"diagram-eyebrow\">Fishbone · post-mortem</span>\n    <span class=\"diagram-title\">Why checkout p95 went past 2 seconds</span>\n    <span class=\"diagram-dek\">Six categories investigated; the confirmed root cause is the accent bone.</span>\n  </figcaption>\n  <div class=\"diagram-canvas\" style=\"--cols: 4; --diagram-node-w: 10rem\">\n    <div class=\"diagram-node\" data-node=\"people\" data-bone style=\"--col: 1; --row: 1\">\n      <span class=\"diagram-node-name\">People</span>\n      <ul class=\"diagram-node-fields\">\n        <li>on-call handover gap</li>\n        <li>no perf owner</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"diagram-node\" data-node=\"process\" data-bone style=\"--col: 2; --row: 1\">\n      <span class=\"diagram-node-name\">Process</span>\n      <ul class=\"diagram-node-fields\">\n        <li>no load test in CI</li>\n        <li>big-bang release</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"diagram-node\" data-node=\"tools\" data-bone style=\